    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/ac-maintenance/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The AC Maintenance theme is a sleek and professional template that is fully responsive, tailored specifically for HVAC contractors, air conditioning repair companies, and heating and cooling service providers. This theme is ideal for showcasing a range of services, including AC repair, HVAC installation, heating and cooling maintenance, ductwork cleaning, and indoor air quality control. Whether you’re a dedicated housewife managing a home-based HVAC service or a commercial air conditioning installer, this template provides everything necessary to build a strong digital presence. It features modern design elements that emphasize intuitive navigation, making it suitable for both beginners and professionals alike. With its fully SEO-optimized and mobile-friendly structure, the theme supports advanced customization for branding and integrates smoothly with plugins like BookingPress Lite and WooCommerce for easy online appointment scheduling. Additionally, it serves as a reliable platform for office cleaning, house repair, and other maintenance services, enabling HVAC businesses and contractors to effectively connect with customers and grow their operations."
    },
